OL,6,
OL,7,FSpeculation about Daniel Craig's
OL,8,Freplacement has been rife, with Josh
OL,9,FO'Connor and Jack Lowden among actors
OL,10,Fthought to have made it to final screen
OL,11,Ftests
OL,13,FThanking those who auditioned,
OL,14,FVilleneuve says "we were surrounded by
OL,15,Fextraordinary talent", adding Pattinson
OL,16,F"brings a spirit that is completely
OL,17,Fnew"
